        "Your site lives on fast UK/EU servers with an SSL certificate, daily backups and monitoring — all included in your plan.",
        "Ongoing updates",
        "Need new opening hours, a menu change or a fresh set of photos up? Send us the details and we'll make the changes for you.",
        "Local SEO basics",
        "Proper page titles, structured business info and a Google Business Profile set-up so people searching nearby can find you.",
        "Booking & enquiry forms",
        "Contact forms, callback requests and simple booking widgets connected straight to your inbox or calendar.",
        "Analytics & reporting",
        "A plain-English monthly summary of how many people visited, where they came from and what they clicked on.",
