      "text": [
        "Small businesses, real results.",
        "We're a small studio too — most of our new clients come from people we've already worked with.",
        "\"Our old site was built by a nephew about eight years ago. Doman rebuilt it properly and now update it whenever we change our menu — usually the same day we ask.\"",
        "\"Enquiries through the website went up almost immediately after launch. The monthly plan means we're not scared to ask for small tweaks — it's already paid for.\"",
        "\"I liked that there wasn't a huge bill up front. It felt like a sensible way for a small clinic like ours to get a proper website without the risk.\"",
        "What clients say",
        "The Copper Kettle, Harrogate",
        "Ellwood & Sons Joinery",
        "Dr. Sarah Hart",
        "Hartside Veterinary Practice"
